{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_04",
  "title": "秉燭",
  "storyCode": "IW-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "eb776b9d412a2e227dfabeefdda87bd34de2d7d1ed63598991da2e19683126c5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "4上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......黑色的酒盞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "那時，那個人用的，是否是這隻酒盞呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......李小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "在！有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "剛才來訪的客人，記住長相了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "記住了......那麼大塊頭的豐蹄老爺，想不記住都難啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......你帶兩盒糕點，去探望一下寧小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "若是在寧小姐那兒見到了那位豐蹄老爺......回來告訴我一聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜役",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "text": "好，可您為啥不親自去——呃......抱歉，我不該問的，我這就去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "恩人，我打聽好了。我們沿著這條山路往上，就到會合的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "不過萬一我們真的誰都沒見著，到時候可如何是好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "那就只能回梁府找鯉先生，他說梁知府正委託他調查酒盞的主人，我們也去幫幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "......如果那個杜小姐說的話是真的，取盞的是位大人物......那位梁知府，真的一無所知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "可如果從頭到尾都是謀劃，梁知府又何必如此麻煩，演這麼大一齣戲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "我們也不是沒見過大人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "......那個自稱信使的少年郎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "哈哈......要是博士在，這些費腦子的事就都能丟給他了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "唉......好想念宿舍裡軟乎乎的床啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "唉，您說我們怎麼就被牽扯進這樣一齣事裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......把茶喝完吧，該出發了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風塵僕僕的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "text": "......唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風塵僕僕的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "text": "應該是這附近了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急匆匆的夥計",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "text": "開水開水，讓一讓讓一讓嘍——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "急匆匆的夥計",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔！留神！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風塵僕僕的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "text": "（雷姆必拓語）——喂！你就非要撞我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風塵僕僕的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風塵僕僕的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "text": "......信？是剛才......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......時間也過了，果然沒來啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "這可如何是好？也不知道炎熔恩人這時候抵達辦事處了嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "我們再等等？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "不然還是先和鯉先生會合——嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......墨魎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "慢著慢著，這些東西是可以離開那片畫卷天地的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "我不知道啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "小傢伙，你從哪裡來啊，你的主人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_143",
      "text": "嘎啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "別咬我啊，鬆嘴，鬆嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是你先惹它的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "阿咬，夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "好——疼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "夕小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "出了點狀況，姑且用這種方法和你們見面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "狀況......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "別想了，幫不來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "我們在尚蜀遇到了追查勾吳城灰齊山一事的朝廷特使......自稱司歲台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "嘖......我還以為年那傢伙來找我，起碼已經打點好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "看來我就不該對她為人處世的常識抱什麼期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "動手了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "倒不至於和官差打起來......哈哈，主要是打不過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "雖然他們是提到了你們姐妹，不過，倒暫時沒有深究的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "他們來到尚蜀，似乎有別的任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "......我不知道這件事，你們有什麼線索？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "與一隻黑色的酒盞有關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "......黑色，酒盞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "我們也在協助一位鯉先生追查酒盞的主人，那盞似乎印著一個圖案......很像是年小姐給炎熔恩人的那個物件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "......呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "酒盞......難怪我總覺得有什麼奇怪的地方，如果猜得不錯，這隻酒盞的主人一定是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "如果真能找到她的話，確實能幫上不小的忙。起碼，能幫忙堵上年的嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "夕！快出來！那老頭煩死人了，嘮嘮叨叨，換你去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "呃，這是年小姐的聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "......你們聽錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "天有洪爐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "要、要不，我們就先不打擾了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "......你們說，你們本來就在找那隻酒盞的主人，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "比朝廷先一步找到她，說服她，最好讓她幫我們一個忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "最起碼，拖到我們抵達尚蜀，不要讓司歲台把她帶走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1",
      "text": "交給你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......唔，回來了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "恩人，夕小姐這玄妙術法，看幾次都感覺好方便啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "反正也不是尋常源石技藝，你就別琢磨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......不過是挺方便的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "......找亭子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我想，像您這樣的挑夫，山上山下跑過那麼多趟，對這片山區，就像自家後院一樣瞭解了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "我也可以現在就告訴你，三山十七峰，不論是舊時古亭還是剛修建不久的觀景涼亭，數不勝數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "想找其中某一個，很困難的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "您能做到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "得費不少事，何況我也是按趟拿工錢的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "天底下總沒有白幫人的道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "當然，這是報酬......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "......龍門人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "是。先生怎麼稱呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "......我姓尚。尚且的尚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "怎麼幫？要我帶路？還是先幫你找到差不多的地方，然後告訴你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "時間緊迫，要是能分頭行動，那是最好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "......你一個外地人，和這個船夫一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "我在江上待過很久，對這附近也算熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "江水不同路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "都在尚蜀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "......別離峰，梓雲峰，青鑾峰，不必去了。這三小峰只是被古人算進了十七峰而已，其實和小土丘沒多大差別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "好，我們今日探尋的重點，其實就在這取江峰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "勞煩日落之前，先生能給些線索......特別是，如果山間哪些小鎮有出名酒鋪，需要額外留意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "酒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "誰言亭台不好酒？每逢獨臥皆醉人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "......那我打聽打聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "多謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "暫定酉時，就在那裡的茶館見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "text": "......回見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "你倒是隨性，隨便抓個人就托人辦事，不怕被騙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "當偵探嘛。總要背負點風險的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "你信得過他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "勉強信得過。他剛才一路走過，不少店家都在和他打招呼，說明他人緣不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "一個願意為了這點小錢就騙我一個外地人的挑夫，不會在這附近有這麼好的人緣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "而且再怎麼也比無頭蒼蠅亂找來得強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "說得也有道理......那我們一會先去哪裡？有線索嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "一個被咱們知府大人一口咬定在尚蜀地界，但又根本找不著的人，壓根不會在這尋常山鎮裡待著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "所以問題多半在那隻酒盞上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "加上......既然還有人來搶這隻名不見經傳的酒盞，就更說明，這個物件，才是關鍵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "慎師傅，你說如果我們又遇到了那晚的賊人，咱倆合計一番，能否協力退敵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "唉，我安安穩穩在江上待了幾十年，唯一憂心的事情就是孫子孫女的學業，沒打過架，真遇上賊人，麻煩得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "我就老老實實當個嚮導，鯉小子，你要是真不放心，我勸你哪，還是早點去找梁大人要兩個保鏢來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "混江湖的，真能不濕鞋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "我在江上這幾十年啊，是真沒遇見過什麼事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "咱們這一路巡山，要是不留神撞著幾隻野獸，我倒是能保證護你周全......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "不過這幾年大興土木的，山裡哪還有野獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......野獸不常見，不過，尚蜀可有一種......背上長著金屬器皿的生物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "......那是啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我也不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "你在哪兒看見的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "text": "嗷......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "眼前看見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "這......這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "text": "嗷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "唔，跑了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "......是被嚇跑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "喂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "酒盞在你身上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的鎮民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "text": "我們是鄭掌櫃的人，掌櫃的在這鎮子裡也有家小餐館，請你吃頓午飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "text": "......跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "真搞不懂大小姐和掌櫃的在搞什麼。派個這麼麻煩的差事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "一會要跟著搶貨，一會又要掩護貨不被奪走，還要妨礙雇主......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "喂，起來啦，你看那邊的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "......站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......這位大哥，有何指教？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "呃......那個......我是來旅遊的，結果錢包丟了，人生地不熟的，你能不能幫個忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......你們幾位，一起丟的錢包？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "不，不是，是......是大家一起出來玩，懶得背包嘛，就把照相機啊錢包啊放進一個包裡了，然後包丟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "text": "也不麻煩您啦，能幫我們回山下的酒店，報了警，一定會找機會報答小哥的，麻煩了，幫幫忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "已經這麼晚了......天黑得真早啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "小烏有，梁府怎麼走來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "......這邊，恩人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "尚蜀的大街小巷，繁花似錦，走在高樓之上，平視山巒，俯瞰夜市，確實別有一番韻味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "......與勾吳城，是截然不同的風景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "是啊。風景不錯，視野也好。最重要的是，能聞到風裡夾雜的鐵銹氣味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "我的劍許久未曾出鞘，談何生銹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "找我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "當然......羅德島還是涉事過深了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......你已經調查過我們了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "送克洛絲姐姐一個炎國詞彙，“法網恢恢”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "不問種族，不問出身，不問貧富，對待感染者一視同仁，致力於救助感染者的醫療企業——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "——這天底下最清白的天岳山泉，恐怕也沒有羅德島來得清澈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......過獎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "啊......別誤會，我並不是在威脅二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "畢竟如果羅德島真是什麼可疑的組織，那恐怕現在，二位已經在牢裡等著傳喚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "即是說，眼下這個狀況，還請二位當作一種“信任”來對待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "我是不是該說“謝謝”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "感染者再怎麼也不該正大光明地在鬧市區來來往往，多少還是要注意點安全問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "隨我換個地方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "（怎麼辦？恩人，這小子明顯有詐啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "（不一定，而且我們又沒得選......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "好啊，那就換個地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "好，那我看兩位也身手不凡，一刻鐘後，我在北邊那座五紡閣樓上，等著二位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "......這就是你們炎國功夫裡所謂的輕功？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "算是。當然了，看那位小哥的功夫，也不算什麼普通人就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "......好吧，其實是了不得的身法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "很少看你這麼嚴肅哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "哈哈，恩人說笑了，我不是時刻嚴以律己，一絲不苟的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "以他的年紀，能有這樣的身手......天賦異稟師出名門，那都是低估了的。我看，還是用匪夷所思得當。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "text": "我就說，能讓那個牛大官兒當保鏢的公子哥，肯定不是什麼軟柿子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "text": "他們明顯知道年和夕的事情，自然，也就知道鯉先生的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
